<overview>
<p>The AFFS treats its infantry as professionals rather than expendable garrison filler, drawing soldiers from single worlds or neighboring systems to build the unit cohesion that the Federated Suns considers essential to effective combined-arms operations. Towing Sniper cannon, a direct-fire variant of the standard Sniper artillery piece, these platoons engage targets with heavy-caliber shells that can breach reinforced positions.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on production date of AFFS 3067+ advanced infantry kit.  Federated Long Rifle is the classic long arm of the AFFS.
</notes>

